# Sales Forecasting Model

## 📝 Project Overview

This Excel model forecasts monthly sales using historical data trends and seasonal factors. It's designed for small-to-medium enterprises to better predict revenue and manage cash flow.

## 🔧 Tools & Skills Used
- Microsoft Excel (LINEST, TREND, FORECAST functions)
- Time-series analysis
- Data cleansing and transformation
- Visualization using charts

## 📈 Key Features
- Historical sales data analysis
- Forecasting for upcoming 12 months
- Seasonality adjustment
- Visual comparison of actual vs forecasted sales

## 💡 Business Insight

This model enables more accurate revenue planning, helps anticipate demand changes, and supports proactive business strategy.
